{"id":"c1eccc44c3c4ece9","group":"57","path":"57/57-thm-interpretation-preservation.md","title":"Syntactic Interpretation Preserves Derivability","display":"thm-interpretation-preservation — Syntactic Interpretation Preserves Derivability","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Mathematical Logic","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-thm-interpretation-preservation","aliases":["57-thm-interpretation-preservation"],"display":"thm-interpretation-preservation — Syntactic Interpretation Preserves Derivability","depends_on":["[[57-df-syntactic-interpretation]]","[[57-df-derivable]]","[[57-df-provable]]","[[57-df-sentence]]","[[57-df-proof-system]]","[[57-df-derivation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-thm-interpretation-preservation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-thm-interpretation-preservation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-interpretation-preservation — Syntactic Interpretation Preserves Derivability"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5c06742bc27c04ba\" href=\"?note=5c06742bc27c04ba\" title=\"57-df-syntactic-interpretation\">57-df-syntactic-interpretation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5d26264b420dc144\" href=\"?note=5d26264b420dc144\" title=\"57-df-derivable\">57-df-derivable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"973e8f8c36bdfa9d\" href=\"?note=973e8f8c36bdfa9d\" title=\"57-df-provable\">57-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"38cb16fd577caf7b\" href=\"?note=38cb16fd577caf7b\" title=\"57-df-sentence\">57-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e4941b4bb46ac821\" href=\"?note=e4941b4bb46ac821\" title=\"57-df-proof-system\">57-df-proof-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"32599757d6ca82d8\" href=\"?note=32599757d6ca82d8\" title=\"57-df-derivation\">57-df-derivation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I,e=\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\mathcal I}\">\\(\\mathcal I,e=\\mathrm{Eval}_{\\mathcal I}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5c06742bc27c04ba\" href=\"?note=5c06742bc27c04ba\" title=\"57-df-syntactic-interpretation\">57-df-syntactic-interpretation</a> 的明确选择环境。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P\\in S_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{ProofSys}\">\\(\\mathcal P\\in S_1\\text{-}\\mathrm{ProofSys}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal Q\\in S_2\\text{-}\\mathrm{ProofSys}\">\\(\\mathcal Q\\in S_2\\text{-}\\mathrm{ProofSys}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_1}\">\\(\\Phi\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_1}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_1}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{S_1}\\)</span>。假定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall a\\in\\mathcal P.\\mathrm{Ax}\\;(\\varnothing\\vdash_{\\mathcal Q}e(a))\">\\(\\forall a\\in\\mathcal P.\\mathrm{Ax}\\;(\\varnothing\\vdash_{\\mathcal Q}e(a))\\)</span>；并且对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathcal P.\\mathrm{Rules}\">\\(R\\in\\mathcal P.\\mathrm{Rules}\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_1}^k\">\\(\\vec\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_1}^k\\)</span>，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R:\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_1}^k\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_1}\">\\(R:\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_1}^k\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_1}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{e(\\theta_i):1\\le i\\le k\\}\\vdash_{\\mathcal Q}e(R(\\vec\\theta))\">\\(\\{e(\\theta_i):1\\le i\\le k\\}\\vdash_{\\mathcal Q}e(R(\\vec\\theta))\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Proof}\">\\(\\mathrm{Proof}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"32599757d6ca82d8\" href=\"?note=32599757d6ca82d8\" title=\"57-df-derivation\">57-df-derivation</a>；原“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi:\\Phi\\vdash\\varphi\">\\(\\pi:\\Phi\\vdash\\varphi\\)</span>”表示相应源或目标系统的 Proof 谓词。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal P}(\\pi,\\Phi,\\varphi)\\to\\exists\\pi^{\\mathcal I}\\;\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal Q}(\\pi^{\\mathcal I},\\Phi^{\\mathcal I},\\varphi^{\\mathcal I}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal P}(\\pi,\\Phi,\\varphi)\\to\\exists\\pi^{\\mathcal I}\\;\\mathrm{Proof}_{\\mathcal Q}(\\pi^{\\mathcal I},\\Phi^{\\mathcal I},\\varphi^{\\mathcal I}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>三个语法交换条件本身不保证保留逻辑公理或推理规则。公理可证明性与逐规则有限模拟条件可沿原有限证明拼接，且不假设待证的任意推导保持结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-syntactic-interpretation","status":"resolved","id":"5c06742bc27c04ba","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-syntactic-interpretation]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-derivable","status":"resolved","id":"5d26264b420dc144","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-derivable]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"973e8f8c36bdfa9d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"38cb16fd577caf7b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":